0..75 Comment "// An abandoned stack runs the unwind of each access it captured, innermost"
76..153 Comment "// first, in place of the write-back it never reaches; its other frames never"
154..226 Comment "// run. Each captured frame\'s destructor runs in reverse order (Congard,"
227..301 Comment "// Munch-Maccagnoni and Douence, _Linear Effects, Exceptions, and Resource"
302..378 Comment "// Safety_, 2025, arXiv:2510.23517). An unwind that calls a declaration owed"
379..442 Comment "// its body blames the run, which shows the abandonment ran it."
444..507 Comment "/// A declaration owed its body: a run that calls it is blamed."
